  "placement": "Append-only grammar units, missions and enrichments. Existing four programme objects and every saved day index remain unchanged. Existing chapter mission links expose supplementary grammar in chapter detail; the new missions are available in the ordinary course path. No new mastery or automatic A2-diagnostic claim is made.",
  "scopeLimits": [
    "Plural-spelling patterns include stated exceptions and learned forms; they do not predict every Italian noun.",
    "Body-noun tasks request the common feminine models explicitly and do not reject other documented forms outside those prompts.",
    "Alterations cover transparent literal-size models, not every lexicalised or affectionate meaning.",
    "Auxiliary alternation is bounded to cominciare/finire; other alternating verbs still need separate contexts.",
    "Partitive ne practice covers explicit countable quantities; other senses, mass nouns and broader agreement variation remain outside these tasks.",
    "Short-command practice covers the five tu families with single pronouns and the gli exception; longer clitic combinations remain a separate topic.",
    "Formal writing covers one short original enquiry, not a complete employment-letter or CV-writing course.",
    "Captured media do not establish independently assessed listening or pronunciation. The unknown publisher page264 remains unresolved."
  ],
